<article class="enc-article">
<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Giberto da Correggio</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1321</span> · <a href="/centuries/14th-century">14th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Giberto da <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/antonio-da-correggio">Correggio</a> was a noble of Parma who made himself lord of the city in 1303. A shifting ally of the Ghibellines and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/house-of-welf">Guelphs</a>, he extended his power over neighbouring cities for a time before being expelled from Parma in 1316.</p></div>
